  Hypothesis TPR : ltac2:(zQ "60!j7!jv0!lhc!jv6!mp5!hv1@2$3@2$1+mqiho8@2$2@1$0#k0?2tp@2$1@2$5@2$2@1$0#k0?2tp+hgg0$4").
